flowchart LR
  TUI[Backtest Loop TUI tab] --> CLI[One backtest-loop CLI child]
  CLI --> W[Validate and preview all calendar windows]
  W --> Mode{Train each iteration?}
  Mode -->|yes| Train[Fresh training on expanding window]
  Train -->|exact returned artifact path| A
  Mode -->|no: fixed artifact| A
  A[Validated immutable artifact] --> M[ModelSignalGenerator]
  B[Cached historical bars<br/>tradables + SPY] --> H[HistoricalMarketDataService]
  H --> R[BacktestRunner]
  R --> E[TradingEngine]
  M --> E
  E --> S[SimulatedBroker]
  S -->|order at t queued| N[next bar t+1]
  N -->|fill at open, mark at close| E
  E --> P[Run-scoped persistence + analyzer]
  P --> G[Grafana Backtest Loops<br/>loop UUID + iteration; independent returns]
  P --> Next{More iterations?}
  Next -->|yes: fresh broker and capital| Mode
